CATEGORIES:storytime,library,baby,toddler,reading
DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Chicago Public Library\\nCost: free\\nAges: 0-60 mo
 nths\\nCategory: Storytime\\n\\nJoin us for a classic Bogart film for comm
 unity cinema\, In A Lonely Place ! A down on his luck screenwriter relucta
 ntly agrees to adapt a trashy bestseller to the silver screen. Rather than
  read the book himself\, Steele convinces a star-struck hatcheck girl\, Mi
 ldred Atkinson\, to accompany him home and tell him the story in her own w
 ords. Later that night\, Mildred is found murdered and Steele\, who has a 
 history of violent behavior\, becomes the prime suspect. A neighbor who is
  attracted to him lie\\n\\nMore info: https://chipublib.bibliocommons.com/
 events/6a3c1a0296ee38a44a92bd6a
LOCATION:Rogers Park\, 6907 N. Clark St.\, Chicago\, IL 60626
