DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Chicago Public Library\\nCost: free\\nAges: 0-60 mo
 nths\\nCategory: Community\\n\\nJoin the Rogers Park Branch Mystery Group 
 as we discuss Lisa Lutz' Curse of the Spellmans . After Izzy Spellman\, PI
 \, is arrested for the fourth time in three months\,she writes it off as a
  job hazard. She's been (obsessively) keeping surveillance on a suspicious
  next door neighbor (suspect's name: John Brown)\, convinced he's up to no
  good—even if her parents (the management at Spellman Investigations) ar
 e not. When the (displeased) management refuses to bail Izzy out\, it is M
 orty\, Izzy's octogena\\n\\nMore info: https://chipublib.bibliocommons.com
